## Architecture

- **Angular 21** standalone architecture (no NgModules)
- **Component prefix**: `{{ model.manifest.component_prefix }}`
- **Styling**: SCSS with CSS custom properties (design tokens)
- **Routing**: Lazy-loaded feature routes with auth, permission and tenant guards
- **Authentication**: Cognito authorization code + PKCE, runtime configuration (`assets/app-config.json`)
- **HTTP**: Interceptor-based auth (exact API destination, one shared refresh) and error handling
- **Error handling**: Global ErrorHandler with structured logging
{{ if model.manifest.ui_targets | array.contains "mobile" }}
- **Mobile**: Ionic + Capacitor for native deployment
- **Platform detection**: PlatformService for adaptive behavior
{{ end }}

